The '''Lido system''' was a [[star system]] that contained<ref name="Bounty Lost" /> the [[planet]]<ref name="AudioDescription">Per the Audio Description for "[[Bounty Lost]]" available on [[Disney+]].</ref> [[Bora Vio]], which was home to an abandoned [[Kaminoan]] [[Bora Vio cloning facility|facility]]. After the young [[Cloning|clone]] [[Omega]] was captured by the [[bounty hunter]] [[Cad Bane]] and taken to Bora Vio to be delivered to the Kaminoans, the former [[clone commando]] unit known as the [[Clone Force 99|Bad Batch]] tracked her to the system.<ref name="Bounty Lost" />

